# Cloudflare Worker URL — receives booking submissions from the static site
# and sends two emails via Resend (chauffeur notification + customer auto-
# confirmation). After you deploy the Worker (see worker/README.md), Wrangler
# prints the URL — paste it here. The Worker URL is baked into the static
# build at compile time, so re-run `npm run build` after updating this.
PUBLIC_WORKER_URL=https://driver-services-form.your-subdomain.workers.dev
